# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Fling deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power as it was sacrificed.
# Forcing: Grizzly Bears starts at two power and the opponent has five life. Giant Growth must resolve before Fling's sacrifice cost is paid.
# AI behavior: Giant Spider blocks the Bear if the player tries to win through combat. The opponent has no spells or abilities.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = Growth makes the Bear five power, then Fling sacrifices it to deal five to the opponent.
#   LOSE = Fling is cast before Growth, dealing only two.
#   TIMEOUT = sacrifice selection or Fling's target did not complete.
# Card roles:
#   Giant Growth — raises the Bear to lethal power.
#   Fling — converts that power into direct damage at the cost of the Bear.
#   Grizzly Bears — the only creature available for the sacrifice.
#   Giant Spider — makes attacking an ineffective shortcut.
# Protocol path: Grow Bear, cast Fling, select Bear as cost, target opponent.
[metadata]
